From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] wine.inf: the shell extension handler keys of every Windows installation (9861)

Windows has HKCR\{*,AllFilesystemObjects,Directory,Drive,Folder}\shellex\ContextMenuHandlers,
PropertySheetHandlers and DragDropHandlers, and Directory\shellex\CopyHookHandlers, in every
installation. A shell extension's DllRegisterServer opens them to add itself; it does not create them.
Bulk Rename Utility 4.1's BRUhere64.dll found no HKCR\Directory\shellex\ContextMenuHandlers,
regsvr32 failed with exit code 5 and its installer rolled the whole installation back. They are now
there, empty, as on Windows.
---
--- a/loader/wine.inf.in
+++ b/loader/wine.inf.in
@@ -388,6 +388,18 @@
 HKCR,.text,,2,"txtfile"
 HKCR,.wri,,2,"wrifile"
 HKCR,*\shellex\ContextMenuHandlers,,16
+HKCR,*\shellex\PropertySheetHandlers,,16
+HKCR,AllFilesystemObjects\shellex\ContextMenuHandlers,,16
+HKCR,AllFilesystemObjects\shellex\PropertySheetHandlers,,16
+HKCR,Directory\shellex\ContextMenuHandlers,,16
+HKCR,Directory\shellex\CopyHookHandlers,,16
+HKCR,Directory\shellex\DragDropHandlers,,16
+HKCR,Directory\shellex\PropertySheetHandlers,,16
+HKCR,Drive\shellex\ContextMenuHandlers,,16
+HKCR,Drive\shellex\DragDropHandlers,,16
+HKCR,Drive\shellex\PropertySheetHandlers,,16
+HKCR,folder\shellex\DragDropHandlers,,16
+HKCR,folder\shellex\PropertySheetHandlers,,16
 HKCR,.png\ShellEx\{e357fccd-a995-4576-b01f-234630154e96},,,"{8b9284a6-ab7a-41df-bcfa-c80995441db9}"
 HKCR,.jpg\ShellEx\{e357fccd-a995-4576-b01f-234630154e96},,,"{8b9284a6-ab7a-41df-bcfa-c80995441db9}"
 HKCR,.jpeg\ShellEx\{e357fccd-a995-4576-b01f-234630154e96},,,"{8b9284a6-ab7a-41df-bcfa-c80995441db9}"
